MID_MV14_00: <SH>
MID_MV14_00_m002: No, Father! Father, please, no!
MID_MV14_00_m003: (inhale/exhale x2)
MID_MV14_00_m004: No!
MID_MV14_00_m005: No! Don't!
MID_MV14_00_m006: That's my father!
MID_MV14_00_m007: NOOO! FATHER!
MID_MV14_00_m008: (sobbing)
MID_MV14_00_m009: I want you to bring me the girl.
MID_MV14_00_m010: (gasp, followed by panicked/struggling exerts)
MID_MV14_00_m011: Your face and your voice...\nI will never forget you! Never!
MID_MV14_00_m012: I will kill you! I will!
MID_MV14_00_m013: I'll rip open your chest...
MID_MV14_00_m014: and give your heart to the god of the underworld!
MID_MV14_00_m015: (rushing in to attack)
MID_MV14_00_m016: (attack exert x2)
MID_MV14_00_m017: (damage exert)
MID_MV14_00_m018: (damage exert)
MID_MV14_00_m019: (labored breathing)
MID_MV14_00_m020: (grunt of effort)
MID_MV14_00_m021: I will live...to see you die!
MID_MV14_00_m022: (labored breathing)
MID_MV14_00_m023: (slow exhale)
MID_MV14_00_m024: (slow exhale)
MID_MV14_00_m025: (slow exhale)